00:00:11.886 --> 00:00:14.222
[Miura, on TV] <i>Thank you all for being here tonight.</i>

00:00:14.305 --> 00:00:18.393
<i>As you all know,</i> <i>I'm Takeshi Miura, the governor of Tokyo.</i>

00:00:19.394 --> 00:00:21.855
<i>I'd like to address</i> <i>all my fellow citizens.</i>

00:00:21.938 --> 00:00:23.440
<i>First of all,</i>

00:00:24.190 --> 00:00:27.235
<i>I apologize for the late hour.</i>

00:00:28.695 --> 00:00:32.490
<i>Regarding the recent disturbances</i> <i>involving the Human Vapor</i>

00:00:32.574 --> 00:00:33.742
How's he still alive?

00:00:33.825 --> 00:00:35.952
[Miura] <i>Fujita Fujikawa,</i> <i>a video streamer</i>

00:00:36.036 --> 00:00:38.955
EMERGENCY PRESS CONFERENCE FOURTH VICTIM

00:00:39.039 --> 00:00:41.708
<i>has been killed in a fire</i>

00:00:41.791 --> 00:00:43.084
POSSIBLE TERRORIST ATTACK

00:00:43.168 --> 00:00:44.753
<i>of unknown origin.</i>

00:00:44.836 --> 00:00:47.255
<i>The loss of any human life is tragic.</i>

00:00:47.881 --> 00:00:50.008
<i>While the investigation is ongoing</i>

00:00:50.091 --> 00:00:52.260
- [knock at door] - [woman] Mr. Okamoto?

00:00:52.343 --> 00:00:53.219
Yeah?

00:00:53.303 --> 00:00:54.763
[woman] Sorry to disturb you,

00:00:55.263 --> 00:00:58.516
But dinner is ready, if you'd please come to the dining room.

00:00:59.017 --> 00:01:00.810
[Kenji] Any chance we can eat in here?

00:01:01.352 --> 00:01:02.854
Oh, of course, I'll bring it in.

00:01:02.937 --> 00:01:05.815
- No, don't worry, I'll get it. - [woman] Whatever you'd like.

00:01:05.899 --> 00:01:08.151
[Miura] <i>the Human Vapor</i> <i>has not been acting alone.</i>

00:01:08.234 --> 00:01:11.237
<i>We now know the identity</i> <i>of his accomplice,</i>

00:01:11.738 --> 00:01:14.532
<i>famed JNT reporter Kyoko Kono.</i>

00:01:14.616 --> 00:01:17.327
- [somber music playing] <i>- A manhunt is underway.</i>

00:01:17.827 --> 00:01:19.204
<i>Her whereabouts are unknown,</i>

00:01:19.287 --> 00:01:23.333
<i>but we believe that she's hiding out</i> <i>with the Human Vapor as we speak.</i>

00:01:24.959 --> 00:01:27.712
<i>According to</i> <i>the Metropolitan Police Department</i>

00:01:27.796 --> 00:01:31.049
[PA system] <i>the possibility of a link</i> <i>between Fujikawa and White Center</i>

00:01:31.132 --> 00:01:32.175
<i>is extremely low.</i>

00:01:32.258 --> 00:01:35.220
<i>They are not ruling out</i> <i>any possibilities at this time.</i>

00:01:35.303 --> 00:01:37.430
<i>Of course, there will be more to come.</i>

00:01:37.514 --> 00:01:39.140
[indistinct chattering nearby]

00:01:39.224 --> 00:01:41.810
[Miura] <i>That said,</i> <i>it seems increasingly likely</i>

00:01:41.893 --> 00:01:46.773
<i>that the series of murders carried out</i> <i>by the Human Vapor and Kyoko Kono</i>

00:01:46.856 --> 00:01:48.775
<i>is completely random.</i>

00:01:50.902 --> 00:01:53.571
<i>I am asking my fellow citizens</i> <i>to please stay home</i>

00:01:53.655 --> 00:01:55.907
<i>unless it is absolutely necessary.</i>

00:01:55.990 --> 00:01:58.118
<i>This is a very dangerous situation.</i>

00:01:58.201 --> 00:02:00.286
<i>If you must leave your home,</i>

00:02:00.912 --> 00:02:04.374
<i>I urge you to exercise extreme caution.</i>

00:02:05.667 --> 00:02:06.918
<i>Once again,</i>

00:02:07.001 --> 00:02:08.753
<i>I don't wish to cause alarm,</i>

00:02:08.837 --> 00:02:12.924
<i>but the possibility of an indiscriminate</i> <i>terrorist act is significant.</i>

00:02:13.007 --> 00:02:18.471
<i>Please take every precaution you can</i> <i>and refrain from any unnecessary outings.</i>

00:02:18.555 --> 00:02:20.807
<i>I cannot emphasize this enough.</i>

00:02:22.142 --> 00:02:23.393
<i>I can assure you,</i>

00:02:23.476 --> 00:02:26.563
<i>the authorities are doing</i> <i>everything possible to keep you safe.</i>

00:02:30.400 --> 00:02:32.402
[music fades out]

00:02:32.485 --> 00:02:35.780
[man on video] <i>Times change,</i> <i>and the notion of the strongest beings,</i>

00:02:35.864 --> 00:02:39.993
<i>you know, gods and great powers,</i> <i>and all that crap, it changes.</i>

00:02:40.076 --> 00:02:42.829
<i>Think about where we were</i> <i>in the 1800s till now</i>

00:02:55.175 --> 00:02:59.095
[Kaho, on video] <i>Very exciting,</i> <i>we got two applications come our way,</i>

00:02:59.179 --> 00:03:01.723
<i>from Yajima and Komoto Bad.</i>

00:03:01.806 --> 00:03:03.683
[Fujita] <i>Our two chosen ones!</i>

00:03:03.766 --> 00:03:08.396
<i>Fujita Occultic's Point!</i>

00:03:10.023 --> 00:03:11.441
[Fujita screams]

00:03:11.524 --> 00:03:13.318
[Fujita screams again]

00:03:13.401 --> 00:03:14.235
<i>Okay!</i>

00:03:14.736 --> 00:03:17.113
<i>That was two screams. </i>[groans]

00:03:17.197 --> 00:03:19.449
<i>But unfortunately, it's not enough!</i>

00:03:19.532 --> 00:03:20.658
<i>We need more blood!</i>

00:03:20.742 --> 00:03:24.412
{\an8}<i>- More blood, more blood!</i> - [Kaho] <i>They're gonna complain again.</i>

00:03:24.913 --> 00:03:28.499
{\an8}<i>- Yajima, I have five words for you.</i> - [poignant music playing]

00:03:28.583 --> 00:03:31.002
[Fujita] <i>Aim for the scream empire!</i>

00:03:31.085 --> 00:03:33.880
- [Fujita screams] - [Kaho] <i>Oh my God, you need to stop!</i>

00:03:33.963 --> 00:03:36.299
[Fujita chuckles] <i>That was epic!</i>

00:03:36.382 --> 00:03:38.176
<i>Kaho </i>[Fujita laughs]

00:03:38.259 --> 00:03:40.303
<i>- Kaho, come here.</i> - [Kaho] <i>It's not happening.</i>

00:03:40.386 --> 00:03:43.014
[Fujita] <i>What's his name again?</i> <i>The guy? Tomato, or, uh</i>

00:03:43.097 --> 00:03:44.057
[Kaho] <i>Komoto Bad?</i>

00:03:44.140 --> 00:03:46.559
[Fujita] <i>Let's say thank you</i> <i>to Komoto Bad, on camera.</i>

00:03:46.643 --> 00:03:48.478
[Kaho] <i>I told you. Not gonna happen.</i>

00:03:48.561 --> 00:03:51.689
[Fujita] <i>Let the world see</i> <i>your beautiful face! Get over here!</i>

00:03:51.773 --> 00:03:52.941
[Kaho] <i>Not happening</i>

00:03:53.024 --> 00:03:54.901
JNT REPORTER KYOKO KONO WANTED!

00:03:54.984 --> 00:03:57.362
- [Fujita] <i>Come on, my sister.</i> - [Kaho] <i>Stop it!</i>

00:03:57.445 --> 00:04:00.823
[Fujita] <i>Everyone wants to see you.</i> <i>It'll be fun. They're gonna love you.</i>

00:04:00.907 --> 00:04:01.908
[Kaho] <i>Give it up.</i>

00:04:01.991 --> 00:04:03.576
- [Fujita] <i>Please!</i> - [Kaho] <i>Bye-bye.</i>

00:04:04.202 --> 00:04:07.330
[newscaster] <i>The Metropolitan Police</i> <i>held a press conference</i>

00:04:07.413 --> 00:04:10.124
<i>in response to the recent murders</i> <i>involving the Human Vapor.</i>

00:04:10.208 --> 00:04:13.628
<i>A new development has revealed</i> <i>that famed JNT reporter Kyoko Kono</i>

00:04:13.711 --> 00:04:15.046
<i>has been working with the man</i>

00:04:15.129 --> 00:04:17.090
<i>and is now on a nationwide</i> <i>most wanted list.</i>

00:04:17.173 --> 00:04:20.051
<i>- Kono is a member of JNT's Social Affairs</i> - [Kaho exhales]

00:04:21.678 --> 00:04:23.137
[man] Excuse me, sir.

00:04:23.221 --> 00:04:26.432
I have the recent approval ratings for the gubernatorial election.

