00:09:44.875 --> 00:09:46.460
[singing in English] ♪ <i>Ellie </i>♪

00:09:46.544 --> 00:09:48.296
♪ <i>My love </i>♪

00:09:48.379 --> 00:09:50.965
♪ <i>So sweet </i>♪

00:09:52.216 --> 00:09:54.594
[Kyoko] <i>Those few months I spent with him,</i>

00:09:55.344 --> 00:09:56.554
<i>they were</i>

00:09:57.680 --> 00:10:00.099
<i>the only happy childhood memories I have.</i>

00:10:00.182 --> 00:10:02.852
Go right ahead and make a wish. Let's hear it. Go on!

00:10:02.935 --> 00:10:04.312
